---
import type {Airport} from '../data/airports';
import {brandEvidence} from '../data/brand-evidence';
import CouponStatus from './CouponStatus.astro';
const {airport:a}=Astro.props as {airport:Airport};
const evidence=brandEvidence[a.slug];
---
<section class="brand-evidence" id="evidence" data-evidence={a.slug} aria-labelledby="evidence-heading">
  <div class="evidence-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SOURCE CHECK</span><h2 id="evidence-heading">本次资料核对：哪些可以确认</h2></div><time datetime={evidence.checkedAt}>{evidence.checkedAt}</time></div>
  <p class="evidence-summary">{evidence.summary}</p>
  <dl class="evidence-status"><div><dt>当前报价</dt><dd>未取得当前官方在售价目表</dd></div><div><dt>指定优惠码</dt><dd><CouponStatus airport={a}/></dd></div></dl>
  <details class="entry-check"><summary>查看本次入口检查与服务归属</summary><p>{evidence.entryStatus}</p><p>{evidence.identity}</p><p>未读取到页面内容，只能说明本次检查未取得资料，不能据此判断服务停运或所有用户均无法访问。</p></details>
  {evidence.findings.length>0&&<div class="evidence-findings">{evidence.findings.map(finding=><div class="evidence-finding"><span>{finding.kind==='official-public'?'指定入口读取结果 · 未核验报价':'第三方资料 · 非当前成交凭证'}</span><h3>{finding.topic}</h3><p>{finding.text}</p><a href={finding.url} target="_blank" rel={finding.url===a.affiliateUrl?'sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer':'noopener noreferrer'}>查看依据 · {new URL(finding.url).hostname} ↗</a></div>)}</div>}
  {evidence.conflicts.length>0&&<div class="evidence-conflicts"><h3>需要保留的差异与缺口</h3><ul>{evidence.conflicts.map(text=><li>{text}</li>)}</ul></div>}
  {a.coupon&&<div class="evidence-coupon"><h3>优惠码 {a.coupon} 的核对结果</h3><p>{evidence.coupon.terms}</p></div>}
  <div class="evidence-questions"><h3>向当前面板确认这几件事，再决定是否购买</h3><ol>{evidence.purchaseQuestions.map(text=><li>{text}</li>)}</ol></div>
  <p class="evidence-boundary">查询日期仅表示本次资料检查。下方预算分析以引用的参考档位成立为前提；未登录核价、未付款，也未开展网络或应用实测。</p>
</section>
